WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
1. Start with typed transactions
Eight records total 365, including a refund. Dates and amounts must be numeric.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
2. Select Travel and the inclusive start
Keep Travel on or after January 1, 2026. January 2025 is a different period.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
3. Stop before the next month starts
Date < February 1 includes January 31 at 23:59:59. Exactly February 1 is excluded.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
4. See why a midnight cutoff fails
Date <= January 31 means midnight at the start of that day. It misses the late-night 60.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
5. Reconcile the complete summary
Keep the year in every month key. All category totals sum back to the original 365.
